### Data Feasibility Checkpoint

The initial research phase will determine whether available sources support a local literacy trend analysis for 2020–2026.

If comparable observations are unavailable, the study will present an available literacy baseline alongside separately labeled demographic and workforce trends. Changes to the population, research period, or analytical questions will be documented and agreed upon by both collaborators.

